###  Add a User
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username" : "Deepu123",
    "email" : "deepu123@gmail.com",
    "password" : "deepu123"
}

### List all the Users
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/ 
Accept: application/json

### Delete a User
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/1/

### Add Memberships By the Admin
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/membership/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Athul123:athul123

{
    "member" : 4,
    "plan_name" : "3 MOnth Membership",
    "duration" : "90 Days",
    "amount" : 3500,
    "start_date" : "2026-11-16",
    "end_date": "2027-2-15",
    "status" : "Active"
}

### List all Memberships by the Admin
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/membership/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic Athul123:athul123

### Retrieve One MemberShip
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/membership/8/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic Athul123:athul123

### Update MemberShip
PUT  http://127.0.0.1:8000/membership/9/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic Athul123:athul123

{
    
    "member" : 2,
    "plan_name" : "1 MOnth Membership",
    "duration" : "30 Days",
    "amount" : 2000,
    "start_date" : "2026-11-16",
    "end_date": "2027-12-15",
    "status" : "Active"
}

### Delete a MemberShip
DELETE    http://127.0.0.1:8000/membership/10/
Authorization: Basic Athul123:athul123
